	"Description": "[size=5]Information:[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=3]This mod is a collection of edits that I made for other mods that add their own additions to the interface so that they match the theme of\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/4697]Vintage Interface v2[/url].\u00A0It\u00A0is somewhat jarring to be suddenly hit with bright orange after all!\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />[/size]Mods:\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/8048]Abilities Experience Bar[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1538]Animal Husbandry Mod[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/6017]Better Jukebox[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2012]Better Shop Menu[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/21620]Crafting Collections Page[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/23359]Customize Dresser[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/11436]Deluxe Journal[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/8505]Event Lookup[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/9969]Fashion Sense[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/12467]Font Settings[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/520]Happy Birthday[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2536]Mod Update Menu[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/7907]Quality Smash[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/29435]Shop Tabs[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/7495]Show Birthdays[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/569]Skill Prestige[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/11158]Smart Building[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/7871]Social Page Order Button[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/12147]Stardew and Chill[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/12179]Survivalistic[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/23169]Swim[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/12369]Sword and Sorcery[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/6830]The Love of Cooking[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/17265]Unlockable Bundles[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[/list]\n<br />Old Mods:\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/7431]Expanded Storage[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[/list]\n<br />[size=5]Installation:\u00A0[/size]\n<br />[size=3]1. Install the latest version of the required mod (listed in the Requirement tab or as the name for the separated files)\u00A0\n<br />3. Install the mod\n<br />4. Unzip the file, place the folder in your Mods folder, and overwrite the original mod's assets\u00A0\n<br />5. Launch your game and enjoy!\u00A0[/size]",
